flowchart LR
    accTitle: Prevention, detection, and response controls
    accDescr: Prevention combines validated identity, object and tenant policy, safe input handling, and export limits. Detection combines application audit events with identity-provider and endpoint signals in a SIEM. Response stops exports, revokes application sessions, contains workloads, and preserves evidence.
